# PS2 SDK 3.0.3 research path

- **Only:** `E:\usr\local\sce` — full manual Runtime Library Release 3.0.3 install (June 2005), including Docs&Training, Extra Libraries, and SCEE Tools.
- Confirm with markers such as `readme-3.0.3.txt`, `common\include\libver.h` (`SCE_LIBRARY_VERSION 0x3030`), `ee\lib\libcdvd.a`, `iop\modules\padman.irx`, `iop\modules\libsd.irx`.
- Do **not** use `C:\usr\local\sce`, `C:\usr`, `E:\PS2_SDK`, or `E:\AI games\PS2_SDK` for SDK research.
- Never recreate or install into `C:\usr\local\sce`.
